WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.090
In Hawaii, the top speed on a rural
interstate is 60 miles per hour.

2
00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:08.810
On some specified roads in Texas, it's 85.

3
00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:12.670
Cross a state line, and the
sign can change in an instant.

4
00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:16.670
Why should an invisible line on a
map change the rules of the road?

5
00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:19.470
Do drivers vote on the
limit at each border?

6
00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:23.290
In this mission, you'll compare two
ways a country can arrange its power,

7
00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:25.530
and where that power sits.

8
00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:30.690
Then you'll read maps of laws, and see
how the arrangement of power shapes roads,

9
00:00:30.740 --> 00:00:32.630
schools and budgets.

10
00:00:32.680 --> 00:00:37.130
Your mission: explain why the speed limit
can change the moment you cross from

11
00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:39.160
one US state into the next.
